  "2026-08-28T12:21:09.920Z","harness:codex","Verification scope: the existing parser-focused linked test will be rerun after the defining-module attribution and transcript value-contract correction."
  "2026-08-28T12:52:16.853Z","harness:codex","Final review-correction evidence: src/sdk/agent/task-transcript-contracts.ts is linked as the defining parser source. The parser-focused linked test passes 20/20 including successful-recovery topology, terminal field values, malformed paths, non-primitives, and non-finite numeric controls."
  "2026-08-28T13:52:14.793Z","harness:codex","TDD red evidence from PR #1133 exact-head review: focused transcript/parser/gate regression run failed in the two intended cases. The parser accepted independent_transport for successful collection output, and the exported gate dereferenced a missing receipt instead of emitting the required controlled refusal. Command: node scripts/run-tests.mjs test -- tests/unit/sdk/output-contracts.spec.ts tests/unit/scripts/release/agent-task-token-gate.spec.ts tests/unit/cli/error-guidance.spec.ts."
  "2026-08-28T13:54:41.210Z","harness:codex","Implementation evidence: the SDK parser rejects independent_transport for every non-refusal output before corpus replay, and the exported real-transport validator independently fails closed with an actionable diagnostic instead of dereferencing an absent token_accounting receipt. Focused parser/gate/CLI suite passes 77/77."
  "2026-08-28T14:23:08.905Z","harness:codex","Terminal evidence: focused parser, real-transport gate, and CLI guidance suite passes 77/77; repository coverage passes exact 100/100/100/100; the complete static assurance pipeline passes after the implementation."
